  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fee882ff6f159f75",
      "translationZh": "我的第一次尝试没有成功。我基于 Genie 的架构进行了构建，视频看起来很棒，但控制几乎不起作用。按下按键所产生的效果基本为零。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb9dce4e9c6a7268",
      "translationZh": "Genie 将动作以无监督方式学习成 8 个编码，而这对我们来说控制得太松了。所以我把它搁置，重新用 Dreamer 4 开始。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a84ab8b26c93080",
      "translationZh": "Tokenizer 达到 40.41 PSNR（Genie 的论文报告为 35.7）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4299a5a44cbb947d",
      "translationZh": "在系统崩溃之前可以生成 144 帧",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "63646667b3e1aeee",
      "translationZh": "1.57B 个参数、960 万帧、约 150",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1134d54b2fece2dd",
      "translationZh": "两个重要的经验：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7eba3dc9a8d6c30c",
      "translationZh": "（1）其中一点是，150 已经足够了。你现在不再需要前沿实验室来做这件事，而我觉得还没有足够多的人注意到这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2434b45f5f977e43",
      "translationZh": "（2）另一点是数据。我们使用 Procgen 自己生成了每一帧，而不是抓取视频。我们知道每一步中的真实动作，因此确实可以检查模型是在响应我们的操作，还是只是在生成漂亮的运动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a31118b8da0f5571",
      "translationZh": "网站：https://worldmodel-platformer.vizuara.ai/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "243b32e8512b093a",
      "translationZh": "代码：https://github.com/RajatDandekar/dreamer4-coinrun",
